@title STORY • CASSIE: EVERYBODY TELLS ME LAST
@bg restaurant_day
You're Cassie Morales. Saturday morning at Casa Morales, before open. Your mom is singing in the kitchen. Your dad is fixing the jukebox again. It never gets fixed.
Ms. Morales: Mija. Menus. And stop reading the group chat while you wipe them.
Cassie: I'm multitasking. It's a skill. It's on my resume.
Your phone has 300 unread messages. You read every single one. You always do. Because if you read everything, nothing happens without you.
> [Good] Put the phone down. Help your mom. -> a1
> [Bad] Keep reading. Somebody just typed "omg wait" and deleted it. -> a2
> [Sweet] Ask your dad about the jukebox, for real this time. -> a3
*a1
@add Family 2
Ms. Morales: (kissing your head) Look at that. A miracle. Call the newspaper.
@jump a_done
*a2
@add Gossip 2
You spend fifteen minutes trying to figure out who typed "omg wait." It was Shane. He saw a dog.
@jump a_done
*a3
@add Family 3
Your dad tells you about the day he met your mom. In this restaurant. When it was a taco truck. You've heard it a hundred times. You let him tell it again.
*a_done
@bg dorm_room_night
@show alana
Alana: Cass. You know you don't have to know everything, right?
Cassie: Says the girl who color-codes her socks.
Alana: I'm serious. Why do you need it so bad?
> [Sweet] Tell her the truth. -> b1
> [Bitchy] "Because I'm good at it, Alana." -> b2
> [Bold] "Because I'm always the last to find out." -> b3
*b1
@add Alana_Friendship 3
Cassie: In high school, my best friends had a whole group chat without me. For a year. I found out at graduation. They put it in the yearbook as a joke.
Alana is quiet for a long time. Then she climbs into your bed, shoes and all, and doesn't say anything. It's the nicest thing anybody's done for you in college.
@jump b_done
*b2
@add Gossip 1
Alana: (gently) You're good at a lot of things. That's just the loudest one.
@jump b_done
*b3
@add Alana_Friendship 2
Alana: Not in this room. In this room you find out first. That's a roommate rule now.
*b_done
@bg locker_room
The next day, you overhear Suki crying on the phone. You hear "Jamal." You hear "Jayden can't know."
Every gossip bone in your body is screaming.
> [Good] Walk away. Pretend you heard nothing. -> c1
> [Sweet] Leave Suki a churro from the restaurant and a note: "here if u need me" -> c2
> [Bad] Text Maggie: "SOS something is happening" -> c3
*c1
@add Loyal 2
You walk away. It's the hardest thing you've ever done. You hum the whole way so you don't think about it.
@jump end
*c2
@add Loyal 3
@add Suki_Friendship 2
Suki finds it. She doesn't know who it's from. You'll never tell her. That's kind of the point.
@jump end
*c3
@add Gossip 1
Maggie: "cassie what is happening"
You stare at the screen. You type it out. You delete it. You type "nvm lol." For the first time in your life, you keep it.
@add Loyal 1
*end
Cassie Morales knows everybody's business. What nobody knows is how many secrets she's kept.
